# Campaign short link on the forms domain.
/try    /try-inspection-forms/    302

# kitchenchecklists.com is a domain alias on this project; everything on it goes to the Kitchen Line Walk
# demo, which is the only form carrying the demo instructions and the hidden alert-phone field.
#
# The ?phone= parameter MUST survive the hop: it is what fills that hidden field, and without it the
# over-temp demo text - the entire point of the campaign - never reaches the lead.
#
# Netlify's automatic query pass-through did NOT apply here, because the destination is an absolute URL on
# a different host (verified by testing, 26 Sep 2026). So the parameter is matched and re-emitted by hand.
# These rules must stay ABOVE the no-parameter ones, which are the base case for someone who just types
# the domain with nothing after it.
http://kitchenchecklists.com/*    phone=:phone    https://forms.inspectionreadykitchens.com/kitchen-line-walk/?phone=:phone    301!
https://kitchenchecklists.com/*   phone=:phone    https://forms.inspectionreadykitchens.com/kitchen-line-walk/?phone=:phone    301!
http://kitchenchecklists.com/*    https://forms.inspectionreadykitchens.com/kitchen-line-walk/    301!
https://kitchenchecklists.com/*   https://forms.inspectionreadykitchens.com/kitchen-line-walk/    301!
